{"sourceUrl":"http://www.cbeis.zju.edu.cn/2025/0806/c65358a3073268/page.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:59:35.851741+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"http://www.cbeis.zju.edu.cn/2025/0806/c65358a3073268/page.htm","html":"<div><p></p><p><br/></p><p><br/></p><p><span>浙江大学生物医学工程与仪器科学学院诚邀全国重点高校相关专业优秀本科毕业生推荐免试来我院攻读研究生。现将有关事项通知如下：</span></p><p><span><strong>一、报名要求</strong></span></p><p><span>按照《浙江大学关于</span><span><span>2026</span><span>年接收外校推荐免试研究生工作安排的通知》要求进行报名（</span></span><span><span>http://www.grs.zju.edu.cn/yjszs/2025/0728/c28498a3071793/page.htm</span><span>）。</span></span></p><p><a href=\"http://www.cbeis.zju.edu.cn/2025/0806/c65358a3073268/page.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><span>报名系统已开放，请于</span><span><span><strong>9</strong></span><span><strong>月</strong></span></span><span><span><strong>10</strong></span><span><strong>日前</strong></span><span>完成系统申请。未按时申请或材料者视为初审不通过。</span></span></p><p><span><strong>二、申请材料</strong></span></p><p><span>材料清单：有效身份证扫描件、本科成绩单及排名证明（加盖公章）、英语成绩证明、获奖证书、科研成果等。</span></p><p><span>材料要求：按顺序制作成</span><span><span>1</span><span>个</span></span><span><span>PDF</span><span>文档上传至</span></span><span><span>\"</span><span>附件材料</span></span><span><span>\"</span><span>栏。成绩单需提供</span></span><span><span>6</span><span>个学期（</span></span><span><span>3</span><span>年）成绩，特殊情况可提供前</span></span><span><span>5</span><span>学期成绩。英语成绩证明需提供原件扫描件或加盖公章的证明。科研成果需提供论文首页</span></span><span><span>+</span><span>期刊封面</span></span><span><span>+</span><span>目录，或论文全文</span></span><span><span>+</span><span>录用通知。</span></span></p><p><span><strong>三、直博申请</strong></span></p><p><span>直博生需提前联系意向研究所和导师。</span></p><p><span>英语要求：大学英语六级≥</span><span><span>480</span><span>（</span></span><span><span>2021</span><span>年</span></span><span><span>6</span><span>月后有效）；或雅思（学术类）≥</span></span><span><span>6.0</span><span>；或新托福≥</span></span><span><span>85</span><span>（不认可家考成绩）。</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>需提供两名报考学科专业领域内副教授及以上职称专家的书面推荐信（模板见附件），</span><span><strong>电子版</strong></span><span>需是专家签字后的扫描件或推荐书内有专家电子签名，接收邮箱：</span></span></span><span>2530596944@qq.com</span><span>，邮件命名：</span><span>2026</span><span>年推免直博报名</span><span><span>+</span><span>考生推荐书，</span><span><strong>纸质版</strong></span><span>参加复试资格审查时递交。</span></span></p><p><span><strong>四、其他事项</strong></span></p><p><span>参加</span><span><span>2025</span><span>年夏令营及本校考生均需通过本系统报名。</span></span></p><p><span>初审将按专业分组进行，通过者将组织志愿填写。将于</span><span><span>9</span><span>月</span></span><span><span>15</span><span>日前，在学校报名系统中审核通过复试名单，在学院官网公布复试相关办法，请及时关注。</span></span></p><p><span>联系人：黄老师</span></p><p><span>电话：</span><span>0571-87951585</span></p><p><span>邮箱：</span><span>huacow@zju.edu.cn</span></p><p><br/></p><p><span>浙江大学生物医学工程与仪器科学学院</span></p><p><span><span>2025</span><span>年</span></span><span><span>8</span><span>月</span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span><a href=\"http://www.cbeis.zju.edu.cn/_upload/article/files/dd/6a/38efc65f40afa777bc1fa8eaceb0/5158da1a-3ad4-4935-93b1-f07442684771.docx\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">附件 专家推荐书</a></span></span></p><p><br/></p></div>","textSha256":"db543f2a78d9957ad3e1728957c344b4a47b0a4a191fa12203ba6d0641792f84","textLength":762,"sourceSha256":"815b5a5fdb94ddcbab2d75cf6c059bcc258f82502b0a6f5f4e67ba656b0c86e1","selector":".wp_articlecontent","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-edb21f54a377bd917cfe","title":"2025年浙江大学生物医学工程与仪器科学学院2026年接收外校推荐免试研究生申请通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:59:35.851741+00:00"}
